  "_notes": [
    "Deliberately constructed graph for visually testing the listener-page",
    "world simulation across the canonical biome / time-of-day combinations.",
    "Every node carries a clean ambient_tags combo and intentionally has no",
    "audio — the wander engine falls back to a 30-second dwell so the visual",
    "swap happens fast enough to inspect each scene. Click any node in the",
    "graph view or use Teleport to jump arbitrarily.",
    "",
    "Layout: 4x4 grid. Rows correspond to themed groups:",
    "  row 0  forest at dawn / day / dusk / night",
    "  row 1  outdoor habitats (field, mountain, desert, snowy plain)",
    "  row 2  water + indoor (river, coast, cave, dungeon)",
    "  row 3  weather + combinations (urban day/night, rainy field, winter night forest)",
    "",
    "Edges: a ring through all 16 nodes (weight 1.0, bidirectional) plus a",
    "few diagonals (weight 0.5) so the graph reads visually but auto-wander",
    "still prefers the systematic cycle."
  ],
